Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:02:32.10,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 美网女单决赛
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:02:32.10,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}莱巴金娜 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}4 {\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}5-{\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}2{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 萨巴伦卡 · 赛后捧杯致辞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.26,0:00:04.26,EN,,0,0,0,,Elena, boy, you're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.26,0:00:04.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,埃琳娜 你真了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:06.58,EN,,0,0,0,,How did you put together a year like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:06.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,这样的一年 你是怎么做到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:07.86,EN,,0,0,0,,How did you beat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:07.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是怎么击败
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.86,0:00:10.10,EN,,0,0,0,,the two-time defending champion
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.86,0:00:10.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,那位两连冠的卫冕冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.10,0:00:12.74,EN,,0,0,0,,the way you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.10,0:00:12.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且赢得这么漂亮？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.74,0:00:15.14,EN,,0,0,0,,How did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.74,0:00:15.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是怎么做到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.14,0:00:17.94,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, it's tough to find words right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.14,0:00:17.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,这会儿真的找不到词
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.94,0:00:21.86,EN,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I didn't expect nothing like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.94,0:00:21.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话 我完全没想到会是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.86,0:00:23.22,EN,,0,0,0,,coming to this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.86,0:00:23.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,来打这站比赛的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:24.98,EN,,0,0,0,,I've been dealing a little bit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:24.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一直带着点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.98,0:00:25.62,EN,,0,0,0,,with the injury
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.98,0:00:25.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,伤在身上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.62,0:00:28.34,EN,,0,0,0,,but somehow everything aligned together
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.62,0:00:28.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,可不知怎么 一切都对上了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:30.02,EN,,0,0,0,,on my side and I just want
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:30.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,全站到了我这边 我想说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.02,0:00:32.58,EN,,0,0,0,,to say Aryna you are great champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.02,0:00:32.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,阿丽娜 你是了不起的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.58,0:00:35.94,EN,,0,0,0,,It's it's so difficult to play against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.58,0:00:35.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟你打真的太难了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.94,0:00:38.18,EN,,0,0,0,,You pushed to such a limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.94,0:00:38.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,你把我逼到了极限
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:41.06,EN,,0,0,0,,I was diving on the court and just trying
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:41.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在场上一直在扑救 只想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.06,0:00:42.66,EN,,0,0,0,,to get all the possible balls
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.06,0:00:42.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,把每一个能碰到的球都救回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.66,0:00:46.18,EN,,0,0,0,,and yeah just congrats to you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.66,0:00:46.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,也要恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.18,0:00:47.54,EN,,0,0,0,,for all the achievements.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.18,0:00:47.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你拿到的这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:48.58,EN,,0,0,0,,Congrats to your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:48.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,也恭喜你的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.58,0:00:51.14,EN,,0,0,0,,You guys doing an amazing job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.58,0:00:51.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们做得非常出色
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.14,0:00:54.66,EN,,0,0,0,,really I can't find the words now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.14,0:00:54.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,我现在真的找不到词
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.66,0:00:57.66,EN,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.66,0:00:57.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:05.38,EN,,0,0,0,,Then I want to say thank you of course
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:05.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,接下来我当然要谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.38,0:01:07.78,EN,,0,0,0,,to such a beautiful spectators
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.38,0:01:07.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,这么好的观众们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.78,0:01:10.02,EN,,0,0,0,,for amazing atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.78,0:01:10.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢这么棒的气氛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.02,0:01:18.58,EN,,0,0,0,,I honestly I honestly was coming here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.02,0:01:18.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话 我一直来这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.58,0:01:20.26,EN,,0,0,0,,for last 10 years
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.58,0:01:20.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,来了整整十年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.26,0:01:23.30,EN,,0,0,0,,and it was never successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.26,0:01:23.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,从来没有成功过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.30,0:01:24.26,EN,,0,0,0,,Nothing close
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.30,0:01:24.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,甚至都不接近
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.26,0:01:27.14,EN,,0,0,0,,to that and I mean it's it's just incredible
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.26,0:01:27.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以这真的太不可思议了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.14,0:01:28.18,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm falling in love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.14,0:01:28.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,我越来越爱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.18,0:01:30.90,EN,,0,0,0,,in New York more and more and it's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.18,0:01:30.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,越来越爱纽约 这对我来说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.90,0:01:32.42,EN,,0,0,0,,an amazing memories for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.90,0:01:32.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,是一段美好的回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.42,0:01:35.82,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.42,0:01:35.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.66,0:01:39.38,EN,,0,0,0,,Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.66,0:01:39.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.38,0:01:41.54,EN,,0,0,0,,I want to say thank you to the people
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.38,0:01:41.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,我要谢谢那些人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.54,0:01:42.90,EN,,0,0,0,,without who I wouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.54,0:01:42.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,没有他们 我站不到这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.90,0:01:43.78,EN,,0,0,0,,It's my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.90,0:01:43.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,那就是我的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.62,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,太谢谢你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.62,0:01:49.22,EN,,0,0,0,,Stefano, Stas, Stefan, Nick,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.62,0:01:49.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,斯特凡诺 斯塔斯 斯特凡 尼克
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.22,0:01:51.62,EN,,0,0,0,,my fitness coach, he's back home
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.22,0:01:51.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的体能教练 他在家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.62,0:01:53.38,EN,,0,0,0,,in front of the TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.62,0:01:53.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,守在电视机前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.38,0:01:55.94,EN,,0,0,0,,Of course, my family also back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.38,0:01:55.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然 我的家人也在家里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.94,0:01:58.02,EN,,0,0,0,,And all my friends, thank you so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.94,0:01:58.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有我所有的朋友 谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.02,0:01:58.34,EN,,0,0,0,,guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.02,0:01:58.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.34,0:01:59.14,EN,,0,0,0,,You are the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.34,0:01:59.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们是最好的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.14,0:02:03.82,EN,,0,0,0,,And without you, it won't be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.14,0:02:03.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,没有你们 这一切都不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.42,0:02:09.70,EN,,0,0,0,,And last I want
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.42,0:02:09.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后我想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.70,0:02:12.42,EN,,0,0,0,,to say thank you to all people
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.70,0:02:12.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢所有的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.42,0:02:13.94,EN,,0,0,0,,who made this tournament possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.42,0:02:13.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢他们办起了这项赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.94,0:02:15.62,EN,,0,0,0,,It's an amazing event
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.94,0:02:15.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是一项了不起的赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:19.94,EN,,0,0,0,,and yeah it's I can't find words.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:19.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还是找不到词
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.94,0:02:21.38,EN,,0,0,0,,This atmosphere
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.94,0:02:21.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里的气氛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.38,0:02:22.82,EN,,0,0,0,,is just something unbelievable
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.38,0:02:22.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的让人难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.82,0:02:25.62,EN,,0,0,0,,and doesn't feel real for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.82,0:02:25.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,到现在都觉得不像是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.62,0:02:28.10,EN,,0,0,0,,So thank you so much to to everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.62,0:02:28.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以真的谢谢每一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.10,0:02:29.62,EN,,0,0,0,,and yeah looking forward
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.10,0:02:29.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也很期待
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.62,0:02:30.82,EN,,0,0,0,,to come back next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.62,0:02:30.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,明年再回到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.82,0:02:32.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.82,0:02:32.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家
